# CVE-2026-26996 — minimatch 3.1.2 and 9.0.5 (HIGH)
# Transitive dev-only dependency pulled in by eslint 8.x and @typescript-eslint 8.x.
# Fix requires minimatch >=10.2.1, which is a breaking major version for both
# eslint's internal glob usage and typescript-estree; cannot be force-overridden
# without breaking the linting toolchain.
# No production code path is affected (dev tooling only).
# Upgrade path: resolve when eslint 9.x or @typescript-eslint 9.x ships a
# compatible minimatch 10 dependency.
CVE-2026-26996

# CVE-2024-21538 — cross-spawn 6.0.6 (HIGH) — Regular Expression DoS
# Transitive dev-only dependency: internal-ip -> default-gateway -> execa@1.0.0 -> cross-spawn@6.0.6.
# cross-spawn@7.0.6 (patched) is also present for all direct tooling; 6.x is pulled in only
# by execa@1.0.0 which is itself a transitive dependency of the Playwright test runner (dev).
# No production code path is affected. Upgrade path blocked until execa@1 is removed upstream.
CVE-2024-21538

